OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny lingering rain soon
OL,6,Fclearing to the southeast. Then
OL,7,Fgenerally fine and dry, though
OL,8,Fisolated showers may develop in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Brisk coastal winds
OL,10,Fdeveloping. Temperatures near normal.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with showers, though
OL,13,Fcloud will clear overnight inland and
OL,14,Ftemperatures will fall and could see a
OL,15,Ffrost in rural places. Staying cloudy
OL,16,Falong the coast with isolated showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
