OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FFine day Thursday after a
OL,6,Fchilly start with rural frost, chance
OL,7,Fof a coastal shower during the
OL,8,Fmorning. becoming cloudy during the
OL,9,Fafternoon before rain and stronger
OL,10,Fwinds overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy
OL,13,FFriday and Saturday, with brighter
OL,14,Fspells and also outbreaks of rain and
OL,15,Fshowers. Becoming drier and more
OL,16,Fsettled on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
